# The tube from Paseo: in from the east entrance (Motavia 66,21 arrives
# at 27,9) and left until Darum is in the way. CharSprites_ChkMoveLeft
# (ps2.asm:5289) turns a left step blocked by a type-3 object into an A
# press, so the walk ends with his line and no button: loc_E9A8, $1801 in
# the big box. Pushing left again brings it back.

start level $0E 27 9
wait screen level
wait idle
shot 01_tube
walk left 20                 # ends when the box opens
wait idle
expect script $1801          # "I've seen that face! ..."
shot 02_darum
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle                    # the box closed, the pad back
shot 03_back
press left                   # the push again: the line again
wait idle
expect script $1801
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
walk right 2                 # and away
wait step
shot 04_away
expect no-stderr not ported
